9,Italian Music - Slow Italy,https://slowitaly.yourguidetoitaly.com/italian-music/,"February 27, 2021 - The musical scale, the art of Opera and many music terms, such as sonnet, concert, quartet (see: Italian loanwords in English), were also born in Italy and many of the existing European classical music forms can trace their roots back to innovations of sixteenth and seventeenth century Italian music (such as the symphony, concerto, and sonata).",Italian,Indo-European
